               88  REPORT-IS-A          VALUE "X".
      *----------  PREVIOUS DAY'S ISSUES & RETURNS SORTED BY CHARGE DEPT
           05  R9-RPTC-KEY              PIC X(1).
               88  REPORT-IS-C          VALUE "X".
      *----------  PREVIOUS DAY'S ISSUES & RETURNS SORTED BY REQUESTING DEPT
