               MOVE TC423-RS             TO   T323-RS-LAST
               MOVE TC423-ITEM           TO   T323-ITEM
               MOVE TC423-CODED-RCV-QTY  TO   T323-CODED-RCV-QTY
               MOVE TC423-NONCODED-RCV-QTY TO T323-NONCODED-RCV-QTY
               MOVE TC423-UM             TO   T323-UM
               MOVE TC423-CURRENCY-CODE  TO   T323-CURRENCY-CODE
               IF MPLTINFO-COMPANY = "211" OR "281" OR "284" OR "285"
                   MOVE TC423-KELLY-PRICE TO  T323-KELLY-PRICE
                   MOVE TC423-KELLY-PO-UM TO  T323-KELLY-PO-UM
