               ELSE
                   MOVE TC423-UNIT-PRICE TO   T323-UNIT-PRICE
                   MOVE TC423-PRIME      TO   T323-PRIME
                   MOVE TC423-SUB        TO   T323-SUB
                   MOVE TC423-SUB-DETAIL TO   T323-SUB-DETAIL
                   MOVE TC423-ADDL-DATA  TO   T323-ADDL-DATA
           ELSE
           IF SRT-ACTUAL-TC = "325"
               MOVE TC325-CORPCODE       TO   T325-CORPCODE
               MOVE TC325-RS             TO   T325-RS
               MOVE TC325-ITEM           TO   T325-ITEM
               MOVE TC325-STORED-QTY     TO   T325-STORED-QTY
