             IF TC352-MULTI-IDENTIFY = "MULTI"
                 NEXT SENTENCE
             ELSE
                 IF TC352-WEIGHT NOT NUMERIC
                   MOVE "Y" TO NOT-NUMERIC-FLAG
                   DISPLAY "***TC352-WEIGHT           NOT NUMERIC***"
                   MOVE ZERO TO TC352-WEIGHT.

           IF DDAILYTC-TC = "999"
             IF TC999-ONHAND               NOT NUMERIC
