      *------ NOW CALL SUBPROGRAM TO UPDATE A FILE WITH THE
      *------ BAD RECORD
           IF NOT-NUMERIC-FLAG = "Y"
               MOVE "Y" TO ANY-NOT-NUMERIC-FLAG
               DISPLAY "*** CSIS TCDLYAB2 BAD TRANSACTION DATA ***"
               DISPLAY "*** BUF = ", BUF-DDAILYTC
               CALL "TBADTRNS" USING BUF-DDAILYTC.

       996-OVERRIDE-PRINT-FILE.

      *----OVERRIDE THE PRINT FILE TO PASSED PRINT FILE NUM. IF THAT
      *----DOESNT EXIST, USE DEFAULT OUTQ FROM LOCAL DATA AREA. IF THE
      *----OUTQ DOESN'T EXIST, DEFAULT TO 'MCPRT' PRINT FILE (OUTQ=*JOB)

           CALL "COVRPRT" USING OVRPRTF-PARMS.
           CALL "QCMDEXC" USING OVRPRTF-PARM1, OVRPRTF-PARM2.

       997-FIND-CLOCK-CARD.
           READ PERS-I INTO BUF-PERSONNEL
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE SPACES  TO  BUF-PERSONNEL.

